Refinement of the extracted single-token attention kernel.

The Rust body is `src/engine/attn.rs` (`score_at` 101-123, `exp_at` 127-134, `weight_at` 143-152,
`value_term` 155-169, `value_component` 180-218, `KvState::new` 236-289, `KvState::append` 359-401,
`KvState::attn_head` 432-572). The public entry point is `apeiron_word.word_attn_head`, the
extracted wrapper over `attn.KvState.attn_head`; the extracted kernel is `proof/ApeironWord.lean`,
sha256 `7b4a0831ed7cb092c1f065cb5b8db1f959613fc03773cddf631150d1ac67bf98`, 21265 lines, roots
`word_kv_state_new`, `word_kv_append`, `word_attn_head`, `word_argmax_fixed`. The dispatch named
identity `d36462a91d934c53…` (16427 lines); `proof/ApeironWord.lean` was regenerated by a
concurrent workstream mid-task and the gate evidence below binds to the digest above.


## The exact specification from `attn.rs`

Per query head `q_head` at position `pos`, over the causal prefix `0..=pos` (positions past `pos`
are never read):

* geometry (`KvState::new`): `n_layer`, `n_head`, `n_head_kv`, `head_dim`, `cap` are nonzero,
  `n_head` is a multiple of `n_head_kv` (GQA), `head_dim` is in the `fixed_rsqrt` window, and the
  load-time score scale is `scale = fixed_rsqrt(head_dim · 2^32)`, computed once at load;
* GQA head mapping (`attn_head`): `group = n_head / n_head_kv`, `kvh = q_head / group`, one KV
  head serves `group` query heads; the plane row of `(s, kvh)` is the `head_dim` values at
  `(s · n_head_kv + kvh) · head_dim` (position-major, `plane_at`);
* score (`score_at`): `raw_j = round(Σ_i q_i·k_{j,i} / 2^32)` (`matvec.row_dot_fixed`, one
  round-to-nearest `>> 32`, ties upward) and `score_j = round(raw_j · scale / 2^32)` — one
  value-path epilogue `value.round_shift_32` against the load-time scale. Both reductions are the
  exact half-biased integer division `divRoundNearest`;
* softmax (`exp_at`): exact maximum shift `mx = max_j score_j`; numerator
  `e_j = fixed_exp(score_j - mx)` with the documented underflow saturation `e_j = 0` when
  `score_j - mx < -16·2^32`; the `fixed_exp` window `[-16·2^32, 21·2^32]` is otherwise unchanged
  and no attended value is clamped; the total `Σ e_j` is a checked `i128` accumulation, refused
  as `ZeroSum` when `total ≤ 0`;
* weight (`weight_at`): `w_j = round(e_j · 2^32 / Σ_k e_k)` — one round-to-nearest division
  `value.div_round_nearest` against the checked `i128` total, then an `i64` narrowing check;
* output (`value_component`): `out_i = round(Σ_j w_j·v_{j,i} / 2^32)` — one checked `i128`
  accumulation per component and one value-path epilogue;
* refusals: `BadGeometry`, `ScaleOutOfRange`, `LayerOutOfRange`, `HeadOutOfRange`, `RowLength`,
  `PositionOutOfRange`, `CapacityExceeded` (`append`), `ExpOutOfRange`, `Overflow`, `ZeroSum`.

`Numeric.EngineDotRefinement` (with `Numeric.EngineNormRefinement`, `Numeric.EngineSiluRefinement`,
`Numeric.Exp.Part4`, `Numeric.RsqrtRefinement` transitively) is imported for the proved
`row_dot_refines_proved`, `round_shift_32_spec`, `div_round_nearest_abs_bound`,
`fixed_exp_refines_proved`, `fixed_rsqrt_refines_proved`, `engine_ONE_eq` and the checked-`i128`
witnesses; those lemmas are reused, not restated.

## Dense softmax reference and the online reading

The real reference of this module is the **dense** softmax attention over the causal prefix,
`Σ_j softmax(score)_j · v_j` (`denseAttnReal`), computed at the exact maximum shift. The shift is
exact, so the reference is shift-invariant (`softmaxWeights_shift_invariant`). The correspondence
to `softmax_attention_is_online_spinor`
(`proof/corpus/Substrate/Algebra/Neural/AttentionSpinor.lean:462`) is a **reading**, not a
refinement: that theorem states the real online recurrence `num/den = Σ e^sc·v / Σ e^sc` for the
`O(1)`-state `(m, den, num)` scan and identifies the dense form with the recurrence over `ℝ`;
this module does not import it and does not refine the kernel against it.

## Dominant-kernel complexity

`attn_head` (`src/engine/attn.rs:432`) is `O((pos+1) · head_dim)` time in checked integer
multiply-adds and `fixed_exp` calls — the score stage visits each of the `pos+1` keys over
`head_dim` coordinates (`score_at` calls `row_dot_fixed` once per key row) and the output stage
visits `head_dim` components over `pos+1` keys — with `O(pos+1)` scratch for the scores,
exponentials and weights (`Vec::with_capacity slots`, `slots = pos + 1`), and `out` is `head_dim`
wide. Each loop is a linear scan closing after `pos+1` (stages 0-2) or `head_dim` (stage 3)
steps; `fixed_exp`, `fixed_rsqrt` and the epilogues are `O(1)` word operations.

## What is proved here and the residual

Landed here:

* the exact stage specifications (`attnScoreInt`, `numeratorReal`, `softmaxWeights`,
  `denseAttnReal`, `planeRow`, `scoreList`, `valueList`, `idealScoreList`) and the end-to-end
  target (`attn_domain`, `attnErrBound`, `attn_head_refines`);
* the structural unfold past the guard chain (`word_attn_head_unfold`) and the refusal equalities:
